<section
  class="testimonials"
  data-testimonials
  aria-labelledby="testimonials-title"
>
  <div class="wrap testimonials-heading">
    <div>
      <div class="cue" style="--gel: var(--amber)">From concept to reality</div>
      <h2 id="testimonials-title">Take their word for it.</h2>
    </div>
    <button class="quotes-toggle" type="button" hidden>Pause movement</button>
  </div>
  <div
    class="quote-row"
    tabindex="0"
    role="region"
    aria-label="Client testimonials, row 1; scroll for more"
  >
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--cyan)">
      <blockquote>
        “It was a pleasure to work with the Encore partner venue team once again
        to support us in the delivery of the annual Travel Retail Awards. Their
        expertise of the venue allowed us to reimagine the event with the
        confidence it could be delivered.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Ollie Potter</span>
      <small>The Bluedog Group</small>
    </article>
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--violet)">
      <blockquote>
        “From the very beginning, their team demonstrated exceptional
        professionalism, reliability, and expertise. Every technical aspect was
        handled smoothly and efficiently.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Mariela Santillán-Riethmüller</span>
      <small>Liferay</small>
    </article>
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--magenta)">
      <blockquote>
        “It truly felt like having trusted partners on the ground, and their
        support made a real difference to both our team and the overall
        experience.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Sales &amp; Events Manager</span>
      <small>EC Meetings</small>
    </article>
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--amber)">
      <blockquote>
        “Since 2019, I have had the pleasure of collaborating with Encore, and I
        have consistently been impressed by their unwavering professionalism,
        creativity and attention to detail.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Christian Hoehn</span>
      <small>The Ritz-Carlton Abu Dhabi, Grand Canal</small>
    </article>
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--green)">
      <blockquote>
        “The collaboration has always been professional, responsible, and at the
        highest technical level.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Stefanie Bross</span>
      <small>Leonardo Royal Hotel Berlin Alexanderplatz</small>
    </article>
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--cyan)">
      <blockquote>
        “Ben will always bend over backwards to help make the event the biggest
        success it can be, during the planning and onsite delivery.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Sam Hooton</span>
      <small>Taylor Bennett</small>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div
    class="quote-row"
    data-direction="reverse"
    tabindex="0"
    role="region"
    aria-label="Client testimonials, row 2; scroll for more"
  >
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--cyan)">
      <blockquote>
        “And from the moment that we start working together, right up until the
        event itself, they have been collaborative, supportive, and also just
        very fun to work with.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Grace Lewis</span>
      <small>The Stage Media Company</small>
    </article>
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--violet)">
      <blockquote>
        “Partnering with Encore transformed the whole event. The incredible
        sound, visuals and overall production really elevated the experience,
        allowing us to honour and celebrate these women in a truly professional
        way.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Peace Mitchell</span>
      <small>Women Changing the World Awards</small>
    </article>
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--magenta)">
      <blockquote>
        “From our very first theatre show to performing at the prestigious Dubai
        Opera House, Encore has consistently delivered incredible service,
        professionalism, and the highest quality technology and technical
        support.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Lisa Scott-Lee</span>
      <small>Dubai Performing Arts Academy</small>
    </article>
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--amber)">
      <blockquote>
        “I’ve worked with Encore for over 20 years, and the reason is simple:
        trust.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Frankie Baldwin</span>
      <small>Richer View</small>
    </article>
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--green)">
      <blockquote>
        “At Identity, we&#x27;ve partnered with Encore for numerous high-profile
        events and have consistently found ourselves in capable, professional
        hands. Their expertise in technical production is outstanding.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Vicki Galloway-Place</span>
      <small>Identity</small>
    </article>
    <article class="quote-card" style="--g: var(--cyan)">
      <blockquote>
        “The whole crew that we work with at Encore are amazing, supportive,
        flexible and worked tirelessly to make the Trinity May Ball another
        absolute success. I genuinely couldn&#x27;t have asked for anything
        more.”
      </blockquote>
      <span class="quote-author">Ben Goree</span>
      <small>Trinity May Ball</small>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
